[{"id":183464998,"discussion_id":"869a47b9c729a2a5923f634c49dd6003463deabc","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该修复主要针对 `AddRmsNormDynamicQuant` 算子中 `ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 函数的 y3/y4 输出逻辑进行了通用化改造。通过引入 `Y3_MODE`、`Y4_MODE` 模板参数和 `T_GAMMA` 类型参数，使得该函数能够在计算过程中分别将中间结果存储到 y3 和 y4 的目标地址，替代了先前仅输出到 yTmp 的单一行为。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 模板参数扩展**：在原有 `HAS_BETA`、`HAS_SMOOTH_SCALE` 基础上新增 `typename T_GAMMA`、`bool Y3_MODE`、`bool Y4_MODE` 三个模板参数，以支持 y4 输出类型泛化及 y3/y4 的条件输出控制。\n- **`ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 函数签名扩展**：新增 `__local_mem__ float* y3Addr` 和 `__local_mem__ T_GAMMA* y4Addr` 两个参数，分别用于接收 y3 和 y4 的目标存储地址。\n- **函数体内新增条件存储逻辑**：在 `Mul(xRegFp32, xRegFp32, gammaRegFp32, maskReg)` 之后，插入 `if constexpr (Y3_MODE)` 和 `if constexpr (Y4_MODE)` 分支，分别通过 `StoreRegForDtype` 将中间计算结果写入 y3 和 y4 地址。\n- **两处调用点同步更新**：`ComputeYScale` 和 `ComputeReduceMax` 中对 `ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 的调用均已更新，传递新增的模板参数以及 `y3Addr`、`y4Addr` 实参。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-06T10:25:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-06T10:47:16+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183465001,"discussion_id":"4b519ff68ba75784ff7a691a0172c98a5b3c35f5","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n经过全面审查，该 diff 将 Y3/Y4 输出写入逻辑正确引入到 `ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 公共函数中，并更新了两处调用点。Y3/Y4 存储位置（在 `x*rstd*gamma` 之后、`+beta`/`*smoothScale` 之前）与 `add_rms_norm_dynamic_quant_regbase_perf.h` 中的 perf 路径和 `add_rms_norm_dynamic_quant_regbase_single_row.h` 中的 single_row 路径完全一致。模板参数与函数实参的对应关系正确，条件编译保护 (`if constexpr`) 使用得当。未发现此 diff 引入的正确性、安全性、可靠性或回归问题。\n\n---\n\n## 审查总结\n\n- **P0**: 0\n- **P1**: 0\n- **P2**: 0\n- **P3**: 0\n\n**整体风险评估**：此变更风险极低，是一次正确的 bug 修复，使 common 路径（regbase）和 split-reduce 路径均能正确输出 Y3/Y4 结果，与 perf 路径和 single_row 路径的行为保持一致。\n\n**已审查文件清单**：\n- `norm/add_rms_norm_dynamic_quant/op_kernel/arch35/add_rms_norm_dynamic_quant_regbase_common.h` — 无问题\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 0 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 1 |\n\n\uD83D\uDCAC 仅评论\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-06T10:25:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-06T11:21:49+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183465061,"discussion_id":"89ad0de2ef095e9349b4305f22be07b5d6e898ad","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| norm | ✅ [*刘杰*](https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678), [*任如海*](https://gitcode.com/renruhai) (2/2) | ✅ [*刘杰*](https://gitcode.com/liujie12345678) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n liiu-qii, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-08-06T10:25:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-06T17:17:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183482235,"discussion_id":"c58a229383b9d57cb66f3a4a600c8d43be1e3fd8","body":"\uD83D\uDFE1 **Medium Priority**\n\n在 `ComputeYScale`（第 262–269 行）和 `ComputeReduceMax`（第 377–384 行）中，`y3Addr` 和 `y4Addr` 仅在 `if constexpr (Y3_MODE)` / `if constexpr (Y4_MODE)` 为 true 时才被初始化。但随后在调用 `ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 时（第 292–294 行、第 407–409 行），这两个指针被无条件地作为函数实参传递。\n\n当 Y3_MODE 或 Y4_MODE 为 false 时，对应的指针变量处于未初始化状态，读取未初始化变量以构造函数实参在 C++ 标准中属于未定义行为。虽然 `ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 内部通过相同的 `if constexpr` 条件跳过了对指针的解引用，但调用点处的实参求值本身就是 UB。\n\n受影响位置：\n- `ComputeYScale`：第 262 行 `y3Addr`、第 266 行 `y4Addr` 声明处，以及第 292–294 行调用处\n- `ComputeReduceMax`：第 377 行 `y3Addr`、第 381 行 `y4Addr` 声明处，以及第 407–409 行调用处\n\n触发条件：模板参数 `Y3_MODE=false` 或 `Y4_MODE=false` 时编译该实例化。\n失败模式：严格意义上属于 C++ 未定义行为，可能触发 `-Wuninitialized` 编译警告；在开启 UBSan 的构建中会被检测到；极端情况下激进优化可能产生非预期代码。\n\n**建议**：在声明 `y3Addr` 和 `y4Addr` 时初始化为 `nullptr`，确保无论模板参数如何，传递给 `ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 的指针始终是确定值。`ComputeYAndAbsMaxVF` 内部由 `if constexpr` 保证不会在对应 mode 为 false 时解引用该指针，因此初始化为 `nullptr` 不会改变运行时行为。\n\n```suggestion\n    __local_mem__ float* y3Addr = nullptr;\n    if constexpr (Y3_MODE) {\n        y3Addr = (__ubuf__ float*)y3Local.GetPhyAddr();\n    }\n    __local_mem__ T_GAMMA* y4Addr = nullptr;\n    if constexpr (Y4_MODE) {\n        y4Addr = (__ubuf__ T_GAMMA*)y4Local.GetPhyAddr();\n    }\n```\n","created_at":"2026-08-06T11:21:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-06T11:41:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,